---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Artwork from '../components/Artwork.astro';
---

<Base pageKey="about">
<main>
<section data-hero="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:110px 72px 90px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto">
  <div data-art-id="create-about-gesture" data-art="create-about-gesture" data-art-slot="" style="position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:620px;height:620px;border-radius:28px 0 0 28px;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-about-gesture" />
    <div data-art-note="" data-art-label="" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(9,9,11,.82);border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.14);flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — ABOUT</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A">Artwork Placeholder</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">4:5 desktop right-bleed · 16:9 tablet · 4:3 mobile · left 30% must fall to #09090B</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3F46">Final artwork supplied separately</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:720px">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">About Create Studio</div>
    <h1 data-h1="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.03">Creative enough to see what could be.<br>Practical enough to make it work.</h1>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:#A1A1AA;max-width:600px">Create Studio is a digital studio in the Dominican Republic. We exist because good businesses keep ending up with digital presences that undersell them — and because fixing that takes design judgement and commercial judgement in the same room.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" data-cols="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.3fr;gap:70px;align-items:start">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:sticky;top:110px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">The studio</div><h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">Good design gets attention. Strategy gives it direction.</h2></div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">Most business websites are made the same way: pick a template, pour in the content that already exists, publish. It is quick, and it produces something that resembles everyone else and serves nobody in particular.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">We start at the other end. Every project begins with the business — what it sells, who signs off, what makes it credible — and the design argues from there. Technology is chosen because it serves the project, not because it is current. Design and engineering are decided together, so neither ends up compromising the other late.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#A1A1AA">We take a small number of clients at a time, work in Spanish and English, and you speak directly with the people doing the work. Clear communication is not a service line here — it is the reason the work lands.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
  <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">What guides the work</div>
  <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px">
    <div style="padding:30px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">01</div><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Creative</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">A memorable visual identity aligned with your brand — never a theme with your logo dropped on top.</p></div><div style="padding:30px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">02</div><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Strategic</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">Structure and hierarchy that give attention somewhere useful to go. Structure comes before decoration.</p></div><div style="padding:30px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">03</div><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Custom</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">Built around your processes, content and objectives, so the site fits how the business actually runs.</p></div><div style="padding:30px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">04</div><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Clear</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">We explain decisions in plain language. No jargon, no mystery about what you are paying for.</p></div><div style="padding:30px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">05</div><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Committed</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">Scope, timeline and price are written down before work begins, and we hold to them.</p></div><div style="padding:30px;border-radius:22px;background:#0E0E12;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;color:#8B5CF6">06</div><h3 data-h3="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600">Continuing</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7">Launch is a milestone, not the end. Most clients stay on for technical care and growth.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" data-cols="" style="max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 72px 100px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Capabilities</div>
    <h2 data-h2="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1">One studio, the full span of the work.</h2>
    <div data-cols="" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 30px;margin-top:8px"><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Web design and development</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Website redesign</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>CRM and custom systems</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>SEO and performance</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Hosting and maintenance</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:13.5px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.55"><span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:#8B5CF6;margin-top:7px;flex:none"></span><span>Digital branding</span></div></div>
    <div style="margin-top:10px"><a href="/services" data-route="services" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;transition:background .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;text-align:center" data-sh="6">Explore the Services</a></div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:40px;border-radius:26px;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.08)">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">Studio details</div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7">
      <div><div style="color:#A1A1AA;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:3px">Location</div>Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic</div>
      <div><div style="color:#A1A1AA;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:3px">Languages</div>Español and English</div>
      <div><div style="color:#A1A1AA;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:3px">Contact</div>Oscar Lauzardo<br><a href="tel:+18297786137" style="color:#A1A1AA">+1 829.778.6137</a><br><a href="mailto:lauzardo1991@gmail.com" style="color:#A1A1AA">lauzardo1991@gmail.com</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-sect="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:130px 72px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:24px">
  <div data-art-id="create-contact-expansion" data-art="create-contact-expansion" data-art-slot="" style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:860px;height:860px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:#0B0B0E;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.07);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none"><Artwork id="create-contact-expansion" />
    <div data-art-note="" data-art-label="" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(9,9,11,.82);border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.14);flex-direction:column;gap:6px;max-width:520px">
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8B5CF6">ARTWORK — CONTACT</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#71717A">Artwork Placeholder</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#52525B">1:1 centred · core 40% reserved for headline · no internal shape animation</span>
      <span style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3F3F46">Final artwork supplied separately</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:22px;max-width:780px">
    <h2 data-h1="" data-rv="" style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-size:50px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.07">Now tell us about your business.</h2>
    <p data-lead="" style="margin:0;font-size:17px;color:#A1A1AA;line-height:1.7;max-width:600px;text-wrap:pretty">We have said our part. Send the details of what you are building and we will come back with a considered next step.</p>
    <div data-row="" style="display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:4px"><a href="/contact" data-route="contact" data-btn-primary="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6,#2563FF);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Start a Project</a><a href="/work" data-route="work" data-btn-ghost="" style="padding:16px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(248,250,252,.16);font-weight:500;font-size:15px;text-align:center">Explore Our Work</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section data-slogan="" data-pad="" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding:104px 72px 120px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;text-align:center">
  <p style="margin:0;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:54px;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.05;text-wrap:pretty">We Create. <span style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563FF,#8B5CF6);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">You Grow.</span></p>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
